WEBVTT

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.030
<i>Milady Laffinty.</i>

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:19.620
<i>This way! Over here!</i>

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:23.120
<i>Please wait, Milady Laffinty!</i>

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:31.130
<i>Oh, look at what we have here!</i>

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:34.430
<i>In the language of flowers,</i>

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:36.640
<i>the Lagrange stands for freedom, charm and blunder.</i>

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:38.260
<i>Did you know that?</i>

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:53.570
<i>Lord Villagiulio?</i>

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:56.070
<i>My apologies.</i>

00:00:56.070 --> 00:01:01.240
<i>I was just thinking of your older brother on that ship and...</i>

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:11.250
<i>Does De Metrio send all young men my brother's age off to war?</i>{merged}

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:14.470
<i>No, your brother is an exception.</i>

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:20.390
<i>I don't like war.</i>

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:24.560
<i>I can't understand how one human can take the life of another.</i>

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:29.110
<i>Life is a miracle in and of itself.</i>

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:35.490
<i>You are kind, Milady Laffinty.</i>

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:41.030
<i>Your brother will soon become the next king of Le Garite.</i>

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:45.160
<i>He may be forced to fight wars against his will.</i>

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:46.370
<i>That is why...</i>

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:51.130
<i>You must never change the way you are</i>

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:53.210
<i>and be there for your brother at all times.</i>

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:54.960
<i>Of course. Same to you!</i>

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:57.220
<i>Yes, of course.</i>

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:09.270
Why now, of all times...

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:11.810
would I dream about my enemy?

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:15.990
Such a beautiful ocean.

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:18.650
But...

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:21.990
it would look so much better without that thing.

