00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:57.290
The Man Who Came to Kamogawa

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:58.960
Wow!

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:01.920
Did you make all this by yourself, Muginami?

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:04.720
I felt bad for having your uncle cook for us every day.

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:07.300
So I thought I should help out for a change.

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:09.220
Now please help yourself.

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:10.640
Thanks for the food!

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:14.850
Oh, wow!

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:16.150
Success! Success! Success! Success!

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:18.940
This is delicious.

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:22.070
I can serve this at the shop. In fact, why don't we?

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:23.700
You mean it?

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:25.660
Oh, I'd be overjoyed!

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:28.280
Please have some, Lan.

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:31.200
No thanks.

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:35.420
There's something I have to think about.

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:38.460
Guess my plan didn't work.

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:38.920
What?

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:43.880
To be honest, this breakfast was intended specifically for you.

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:44.510
You're lying.

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:45.430
It's true!

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:46.510
Really?

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:47.850
Yes.

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:53.810
We live under the same roof, but Lan still won't open up to me.

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:57.730
I was hoping this would give us a chance to get to know each other better.{merged}

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:59.570
So that's why you've been up since 3 AM.

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:04.900
Sorry, I had a feeling it'd just end up annoying you, Lan.

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:07.820
You're a very honest person.

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:11.580
Anybody would get upset if someone aggressively tried to become their friend. {merged}

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:14.290
I guess I realized that, but...

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:17.040
Fine, I'll eat it!

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.540
Oh, you will? I'm so happy!

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:28.590
Okay, I ate it.

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:31.430
Wasn't it good?

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:32.350
It was good...

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:35.100
Huh? I didn't hear that.

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:36.980
It was good!

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:38.310
'Morning!

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:38.900
'Morning!

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:39.360
'Morning!

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:40.190
Good morning!

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:41.860
How do you like living with Madoka?

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:44.900
Oh, it's super fun every day. Right, Madoka?

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:47.610
<i>It seems you're having a hard time dealing with her.</i>

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:49.950
She took me by surprise this morning, that's all.

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:51.410
Never mind that.

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:54.040
Have you learned anything about Muginami?

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:58.540
No, nothing in the Le Garite database matches her description, either.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:00.460
<i>Any connection with the escaped prisoner?</i>

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:05.710
None. We don't even know how he managed to escape in the first place. {merged}

