<i>What?</i>

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:17.390
"Due to{the planet} Pluto being in retrograde..."{>pluto >planet}

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:20.230
No wonder bad things keep happening.

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:22.310
I'd better limit myself to two yogurts.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:28.650
Continue checking the Le Garite database records on Muginami.

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:30.280
Lan!

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:32.160
Madoka is coming.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:33.780
Contact me if you learn anything.

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:35.200
There you are!

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:37.750
What are you doing? It's your turn at bat.

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:40.000
Bat?

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:48.630
Uh...

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:50.090
Here I go.

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:53.930
Strike!

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:55.760
You're out!

00:06:56.970 --> 00:07:00.390
That's what you get for scheming during class.

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:02.770
Give me your best shot!

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:04.860
I'll get revenge for Lan!

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:12.620
Don't get any closer to Muginami.

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:13.280
Huh?

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:17.290
She's a danger to you, Madoka.

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:20.290
She's plotting something wicked behind that cheerful facade of hers.{merged}

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:22.460
Now hold on a minute.

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:23.960
What's gotten into you?

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:25.670
Muginami is a nice girl.

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:27.800
Remember how she rescued you, Lan?

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:28.710
That's...!

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:35.350
Yes, she did, but...

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:38.220
No! I'm sure that was also her—

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:42.600
And she hit a home run for you just now.

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:44.480
That means she's a true comrade!

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:49.230
Fine...

00:07:49.230 --> 00:07:50.360
I'll trust your judgment.

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:51.700
Success!

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:53.110
Come on, let's go!

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:08.000
Wow!

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:09.960
Can we really use this room?

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:13.260
Sure. As you can see... it's a storeroom.

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:16.050
No, I think this place is perfect!

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:18.180
Oh really?

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:19.010
Then here you go...

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:22.810
Make sure to return it to the faculty office when you're done.

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:24.140
Got it!

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:25.400
Kyouno!

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:26.400
Huh?{horrible mistime}

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:29.650
Now you're one step ahead of Youko. Keep it up.

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:30.650
Right!

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:33.400
Yes! We finally have a club room!

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:34.910
I'm happy for you.

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:37.740
It's all thanks to you two joining the club!

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:41.910
Then I guess we should start acting more like Jersey Club members.{merged}

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:43.290
What do you mean?

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:46.380
The Student Council needs help moving some of their stuff.

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:48.380
Muginami and I shall handle that.

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:49.290
Huh?

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:54.090
In the meantime, you can take care of the groceries that Mr. Hiroshi asked for. Right? {merged}

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:56.220
Sure. Sounds good.

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:57.510
You sure?

00:08:57.510 --> 00:08:59.430
In that case, I'll leave the rest to you two.

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:01.350
Roger that!

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:02.060
Woof.

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:05.480
Don't forget to lock the room!

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:09.110
<i>"Don't forget to lock the room."</i>

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:11.530
<i>"Don't forget to lock the room."</i>

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:13.320
<i>Do I sound like a club captain or what?!</i>

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:14.280
Success!

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:18.450
Shall we get going?

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:20.530
Fresh

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:20.530
Fish

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:20.530
Souve-

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:20.530
nirs

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:20.530
Mihashiya

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:20.530
Thank you!

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:35.510
Energy replenished!

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:39.430
Tonight I'll make an extra large Sangayaki Burger the way Uncle taught me to!

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:43.470
Uncle?

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:48.480
I think that coat would look better on me.

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:51.320
Man, how many times do we have to go through this?

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:53.530
Huh? Have we before?

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:56.240
All right, then the next coat on sale is—

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:00.280
What are you doing?

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:02.330
Hey, Madoka!

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:05.290
This is my niece. Isn't she cute?

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:09.210
This is Giovu... aw man, I bit my tongue again.

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:10.460
Hiroshi...

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:11.790
Y-Yes?

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:15.630
How bold of you to be drinking out in broad daylight.

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:19.340
Well actually, he and I had an argument earlier and...

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:21.180
This is... uh...

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:23.470
Yeah! It's a token of our reconciliation, that's it!

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:26.680
Want a drink too, Madoka?

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:28.060
No thank you!

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:34.400
The only things left are soy sauce and sugar. Now go!

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:35.780
See you.

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:41.280
Sorry about that.

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:43.370
You are in my way!

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:50.870
How about now?

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:52.630
Huh? Wha—?!

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:56.880
Are you all right?

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:01.470
What are you looking at?

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:06.470
Madoka, anything besides white doesn't really suit—!{he's talking about the color of her panties lol}

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:13.560
I see.

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:17.360
She really is cute.

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:24.030
This is my first time in this town.

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:27.950
I walked around everywhere.

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:30.960
But I have to say the ocean view from here is the best.

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:34.590
Thank you.

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:36.550
"Thank you"?

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:40.920
By the way, what did you and my uncle argue about?

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:44.930
Well, there was only one left.

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:54.560
There's no need to argue over something if it's just lying around, right?

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:05.370
Weren't we supposed to help out the Student Council?

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:07.030
What's your purpose?

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:08.580
Purpose?

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:11.790
For what purpose are you trying to get close to us?

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:26.760
I was wondering when you'd ask.

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:31.140
Lan, all you've done was observe me from the shadows.

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:32.770
What do you mean?

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:37.810
Yours is here, right?{the fuck, lagrange writers?}

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:45.530
How can you have the Memoria?!

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:47.820
What's so surprising about that?

00:12:47.820 --> 00:12:52.290
I just stood naked in front of the Vox and then it poked me.{XEBEEEEEEEEEEC}

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:54.620
What do you intend to do with the Vox?

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:57.040
I don't know. Ask Brother.

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:58.920
Brother?

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:03.760
Brother said he wanted it, so I obliged.

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:04.840
That's all.

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:08.510
You don't know just how horrendous the Voxes are!

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:11.640
Are you talking about the "Legend of the Demons"?

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:13.140
You know it?

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:14.850
I don't know the details.

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:19.110
I just heard that it's really, really scary.

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:23.030
But it's just an old fairy tale, right?

00:13:23.610 --> 00:13:27.070
By the way, have you told Madoka about that?

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:30.080
Leave her out of this.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:33.040
What?! You haven't told her yet?

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:35.290
Is that really a good idea?

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:37.290
I'll tell Madoka when the time comes—

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:40.290
Oh! Oh! I have a suggestion.

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:42.250
What?

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:45.550
Brother will be coming to this town soon.

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:51.180
Actually, he should be here any time now.

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:54.560
Then this town will become a battlefield for sure.

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:57.310
I won't let you have it your way!

00:13:57.310 --> 00:13:58.400
Of course you won't.

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:01.320
Isn't that why there's going to be a war?

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:08.360
Anyway, war between us is inevitable.

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:10.820
So...

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:13.660
Let's enjoy this while we can!

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:14.910
Huh?

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:17.370
I meant our student life here!

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:20.960
<i>I just confirmed it.</i>

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:25.300
Like she said, Ignis has undergone Memoria.

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:28.050
How could this happen?!

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:30.800
<i>And as for her "Brother"...</i>

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:31.720
What did you learn?

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:33.470
<i>Same as Muginami.</i>

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:35.720
<i>Not a single match in the database.</i>

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:38.640
It must be a codename, then.

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:43.360
Finding out the identity of this "Brother" is our top priority.

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:44.570
<i>I understand.</i>

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:47.820
"Brother"...

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:50.490
I'm home.

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:52.990
Welcome back. You're late.

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:54.660
You have a customer.

00:14:55.660 --> 00:14:56.500
Giuvi...!

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:58.620
It's Villa. Villagiulio.

00:14:58.620 --> 00:14:59.750
What brings you here?

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:02.170
As an apology for getting Madoka upset,

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:04.000
I helped her pick up the trash.

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.800
Then she said she'd treat me to dinner.

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:07.840
I did not!

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:11.090
I just said we deserved a good meal after picking up all that trash!{merged}

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:13.300
Welcome back!

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:16.350
Hey. How have you been?

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:18.230
Brother...

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:19.350
Brother?!

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:21.900
Brother!

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:27.900
You're late! I've been waiting for you this whole time!

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:32.030
I knew you'd come here!

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:36.370
Muginami, is he your older brother?

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:42.000
Yes. Even though we're not related, he's my brother!

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:46.420
Lan?

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:48.920
You're...

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:50.590
"Brother"?

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:52.840
Welcome back, Milady Laffinty.

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:56.300
Lan...

00:15:57.760 --> 00:15:59.980
Enemy? That Shabada...!

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:01.980
No, Madoka. His name is Giuvi—

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:03.480
It's Villagiulio.

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:05.770
Then what about Muginami?

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:06.730
She's also an enemy.

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:09.360
But she doesn't seem like one at all.

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:19.200
Is it true that you're our enemy?

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:21.290
Huh? Did Lan say so?

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:22.750
Answer me.

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:24.120
Those guys who attacked us last time...

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:25.670
Are you affiliated with them?

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:27.000
No, they're—

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:29.050
You, be quiet.

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:33.590
I'm not your enemy, Madoka.

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:35.470
I'm on Brother's side. That's all.

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:37.640
Which means you're the enemy.

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:42.600
Maybe to you, Lan.

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:45.440
But it doesn't involve Madoka, right?

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:49.320
After all, we're the ones at war.

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:53.990
How can you say it doesn't involve me?

00:16:54.610 --> 00:16:56.030
Madoka?

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:59.370
Of course I'm involved!

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:00.620
We live together!

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:02.080
We go to school together.

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:03.540
We're part of the same club.

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:06.000
How can you say it doesn't involve me?!

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:11.460
I can't just go around having fun

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:14.380
when you and Lan are fighting right in front of me!

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:18.390
Really?

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:21.640
It was pretty fun for me...

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:23.140
Unlike Lan over there.

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:24.850
What?

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:29.190
I mean, we all woke up in the morning and ate breakfast,

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:32.860
and went to school and gossiped, then ate again.

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:36.200
In the afternoon, as we listened to the teacher's lecture,

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:38.110
we took a quick nap.

00:17:38.110 --> 00:17:40.620
Then we did Jersey Club activities until evening.

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:43.910
Then we went home and helped at the shop.

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:46.710
Then we took a leisurely bath

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:49.580
and slept until the next morning.

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:53.090
We did the same thing every day,

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:56.380
but I never had such an easy life.

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:58.970
I loved every minute of it!

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:01.100
Easy?

00:18:01.100 --> 00:18:02.140
Uh-huh.

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:04.980
Which is why I told Lan earlier...

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:07.850
We're going to have to fight sooner or later,

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:10.730
so we should enjoy this life while we can.

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:15.110
But Lan got upset and told me to quit fooling around.

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:17.240
How could you, Muginami?

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:18.110
Madoka?

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:23.370
It makes me sad to know that's the way you thought of us!

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:24.580
Sorry!

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:27.410
But it's true that I had fun.

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:31.790
I really wish this could continue for the rest of my life.

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:32.710
Then...!

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:35.090
But that's not possible.

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:38.510
Right, Lan?

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:43.810
So please understand, Madoka.

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:45.770
This is our destiny—

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:51.900
Oh, excuse me. Carry on.

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:54.690
Wake me up when you're done.

00:18:57.400 --> 00:18:59.280
Oh, well...

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:02.120
This is getting boring.

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:05.330
Let's go, Brother.

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:06.490
Go where?

00:19:06.490 --> 00:19:09.540
Why, back to Kiss where everyone's waiting.

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:10.960
Kiss?

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:12.790
That's the name of their organization.

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:14.880
Hurry up!

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:18.590
Since when did you become one of us?

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:19.300
Huh?

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:22.140
You can't pilot an Ovid,

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:24.220
nor can you handle a gun properly.

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:28.560
All you do is eat and sleep!

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:30.520
Brother?

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:33.310
We put our lives on the line

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:36.730
while you have it nice and easy.

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:40.150
You have some nerve calling yourself one of us.

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:42.660
Oh, Brother...

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:45.620
Look at this. I have the Memoria for the Vox.

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:46.490
I know.

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:49.250
I already know.

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:52.920
Then why aren't you happy?

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:54.210
Why should I be?

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:58.630
Because you were talking with everyone...

00:19:58.630 --> 00:19:59.710
About taking possession of the Vox—

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:00.970
So?

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:03.470
So I...

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:07.350
You took the remaining Vox for yourself.

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:08.720
Uh-huh!

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:10.980
Who the hell asked you to do that?!

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:21.240
Did you think that would make you one of us?

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:22.700
Well?

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:23.990
Stop...

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:28.240
Did you think that would make up for all the free meals you got?

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:30.750
Brother, please...

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:34.500
It's not Brother. It's Lord Villagiulio.

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:35.880
Got it?

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:39.250
Why?

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:41.720
Isn't it obvious?

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:44.260
Because you're a parasite.

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:45.970
Shut up!

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:49.350
Don't stop me, Uncle!

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:52.270
This jerk! This jerk just called Muginami a...!

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:54.770
Get out.

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:04.740
Laffinty...

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:07.200
Tell Moid this:

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:12.580
"Destroy every Vox in your possession by tomorrow morning."

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:13.830
Otherwise...

00:21:14.910 --> 00:21:16.500
I'll destroy them along with that ship.

00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:35.890
That girl is just like you...

00:21:36.640 --> 00:21:38.270
Yurikano...

